      "type": "narrative-update",
      "date": "2026-05-17T13:05:12.000Z",
      "title": "DLF: Upcoming Results And Dividend Decision Will Support Bullish Outlook",
      "body": "Analysts have trimmed their fair value estimate for DLF slightly to ₹822.48 from ₹829.76, citing updated assumptions that combine a lower discount rate with higher projected revenue growth, a modestly softer profit margin, and a small adjustment to future P/E expectations. What's in the News DLF has scheduled a board meeting for May 13, 2026, at 15:30 Indian Standard Time.",
