      "type": "article",
      "date": "2026-05-17T03:22:48.000Z",
      "title": "Earnings Report: DLF Limited Missed Revenue Estimates By 9.8%",
      "body": "Last week, you might have seen that DLF Limited ( NSE:DLF ) released its full-year result to the market. The early...",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": "https://simplywall.st/stocks/in/real-estate-management-and-development/nse-dlf/dlf-shares/news/earnings-report-dlf-limited-missed-revenue-estimates-by-98",
