      "title": "DLF: Steady Fair Value And Margins Will Support A Bullish Outlook",
      "body": "Analysts have kept DLF's fair value estimate broadly steady at ₹829.76. This reflects a balance between a marginally higher assumed discount rate, slightly adjusted profit margin expectations, and a modestly higher future P/E assumption in their updated price target rationale.",
